WEBVTT

00:00:03.183 --> 00:00:07.376
The live dashboard has a panel named Why isn't this dialing.

00:00:07.376 --> 00:00:09.981
It says what holds a campaign back.

00:00:09.981 --> 00:00:13.793
Here it says that no work is waiting to be dispatched.

00:00:15.393 --> 00:00:18.778
Are agents signed in to the campaign and Available?

00:00:18.778 --> 00:00:23.231
The dialer calls only for available agents signed in to the campaign.

00:00:23.231 --> 00:00:25.369
Is the dialer profile enabled?

00:00:25.369 --> 00:00:27.803
A disabled profile places no calls.

00:00:28.553 --> 00:00:30.496
Is the calling window open?

00:00:30.496 --> 00:00:34.913
A closed calendar means the records are tried again in a later cycle.

00:00:34.913 --> 00:00:37.622
Has the abandonment cap stopped dialing?

00:00:37.622 --> 00:00:38.976
Are records left?

00:00:38.976 --> 00:00:40.743
Check Manage Activities.

